{
  "name": "Post a weekly Slack digest of new companies in your niche",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post a weekly Slack digest of new companies in your niche\n\n### How it works\nWatch your market without searching by hand. Every Monday Argorant searches companies whose description matches your keywords, in your country, founded in or after founded_since (three years back by default). Companies posted in an earlier week are dropped, so the digest shows only newcomers. The rest are posted to Slack as one message: name, domain, size and city, at most max_results. Spot a fit and save it in Argorant, or ask your team who knows them.\n\nNo credits are used.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Set keywords, country, founded_since and max_results in **Settings**.\n4. Pick the channel in **Post the digest** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nAdd the new companies to a sheet, or find their founders with Lead > Search.",
        "height": 575,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "549f8944-59a1-419d-934b-aa0da97bf4f1",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Search\nRecently founded companies that match your keywords. Free.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "df975205-2a75-4da9-a593-c960547019b4",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Digest\nOne message with the newcomers, nothing when there are none.",
